&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a motivated and supportive Engineering Team Manager to lead our Foundations &amp;amp; Enablement team — the group that keeps the rest of engineering fast, secure, and consistent. Your team&#39;s customers are other engineering teams: you&#39;ll own the standards, tooling, and shared systems (CI/CD, security practices, developer experience, core platform capabilities) that every other team builds on. You will own your team&#39;s people, performance, growth, and capacity, and you&#39;ll lead engineers across both frontend and backend, so you&#39;re comfortable managing outside your own core discipline. You&#39;ll serve requests from multiple product teams while also driving your own technical roadmap for the platform, and bring strong judgment to prioritize across both. You&#39;ll also partner closely with our Infrastructure team on shared platform concerns. If you&#39;re an engineering leader who enjoys solving problems that make everyone else&#39;s job easier, we&#39;d like to talk.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
