&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;JOB SUMMARY&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Senior Content Marketing Specialist to shape and create impactful, thought-leadership led content across our 6 monthly brand campaign cycles, plus additional ICP tracks as needed, while owning customer advocacy content - e.g. case studies. The right candidate understands what makes great B2B marketing content, is AI-native, takes initiative in a fast-paced scale up environment, and brings a data-driven mindset to connect strategy with business results.&amp;nbsp;This person will sit within Storyblok&#39;s Brand and Communications team, supporting marketing across the buyer journey, driving case study development, and partnering with field marketing, social, and events on content needs. They&#39;ll also help build and launch a new UGC programme and support executive communications on LinkedIn.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;ESSENTIAL JOB FUNCTIONS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Content strategy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape and execute content creation efforts within the Brand and Communications Team, from long-form whitepapers and blog posts to short-form landing pages and other supporting assets that require content support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generate creative, storytelling-focused content ideas that produce engaging thought leadership, staying abreast of B2B social trends and thinking beyond the &#39;usual&#39; types of content&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support aligning content marketing efforts with the wider Brand and Communications team functions, including PR, company social media, and executive communications via LinkedIn&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct in-depth keyword research using tools like Ahrefs and/or Semrush to identify relevant topics and keyword groups for Storyblok content&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Briefing videographers and motion graphics experts to create videos for campaign tracks, events, social to name a few&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimisation and monitoring of content health of all Storyblok content via the website&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer advocacy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ownership of the case study content process, from initial ideation and customer contact, to creation and publication of the assets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimisation and monitoring of all case study pages on Storyblok&#39;s website&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensuring consistent quality across all case study pages by updating older case studies and coordinating with the Partner and/or Customer Success team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Planning measurable outreach strategies to garner more customer success stories in response to business requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Defining and tracking precise KPIs for all case study efforts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EDUCATION AND EXPERIENCE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Must haves&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years’ experience in content marketing or content strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of SEO best practices and familiarity with on-page and off-page SEO tactics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tech industry marketing experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Content reporting experience including analysing data and making recommendations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nice to haves&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Content marketing experience in a B2B tech scale up environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing and executing UGC programmes, particularly in B2B/tech settings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a Brand and Communications team/similar with an integrated content function, having worked with PR and social media teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrable experience building content marketing support agents via the likes of Claude - e.g. to automate processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working on event content&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
