&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly organised, reliable, and self-driven in fast-moving ambiguous environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional written and verbal communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Impeccable creative writing skills&lt;/li&gt;
